{"name":"Delthuntle","status":"ok","title":"Delthuntle","pageId":26429,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-frwiki pi-layout-default type-location\" role=\"region\">\n\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Maps_of_Delthuntle\" title=\"Category:Maps of Delthuntle\">Gallery</a></nav>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Delthuntle</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Geography</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Type</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Settlement</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"region\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Aglarond\" title=\"Aglarond\">Aglarond</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Unapproachable_East\" title=\"Unapproachable East\">Unapproachable East</a><sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-FRPG-p76_1-0\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRPG-p76-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Society</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"races\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Races</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Human\" title=\"Human\">Humans</a>, <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/wiki/Half-elves\" title=\"Half-elves\">half-elves</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Genasi\" title=\"Genasi\">genasi</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Halfling\" title=\"Halfling\">halflings</a><sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-FRPG-p76_1-1\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRPG-p76-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">History</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"established\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Established</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/482_DR\" title=\"482 DR\">482 DR</a><sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-SoFS-p5_2-0\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SoFS-p5-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Inhabitants_of_Delthuntle\" title=\"Category:Inhabitants of Delthuntle\">Inhabitants of  Delthuntle</a></nav>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Locations_in_Delthuntle\" title=\"Category:Locations in Delthuntle\">Locations in  Delthuntle</a></nav>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Organizations_in_Delthuntle\" title=\"Category:Organizations in Delthuntle\">Organizations in  Delthuntle</a></nav>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Items_from_Delthuntle\" title=\"Category:Items from Delthuntle\">Items from  Delthuntle</a></nav>\n</aside>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><b>Delthuntle</b> was a commercial center and port in <a href=\"/wiki/Aglarond\" title=\"Aglarond\">Aglarond</a>.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-FRPG-p76_1-2\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRPG-p76-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<div aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\" class=\"toc\" id=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\"><input class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" role=\"button\" style=\"display:none\" type=\"checkbox\"/><div class=\"toctitle\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Trade\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Trade</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Demographics\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Demographics</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Notable_Locations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Notable Locations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Notable_Inhabitants\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Notable Inhabitants</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Appendix\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Appendix</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Appearances\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Appearances</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Gallery\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Gallery</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#References\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">References</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trade\">Trade</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a aria-label=\"Edit section: Trade\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-action=\"edit-section\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Delthuntle?veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Trade\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The city primarily made a profit through trade with the <a href=\"/wiki/Genasi\" title=\"Genasi\">genasi</a> nation of <a href=\"/wiki/Akan%C3%BBl\" title=\"Akanûl\">Akanûl</a>, especially its capital, <a href=\"/wiki/Airspur\" title=\"Airspur\">Airspur</a>.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-FRPG-p76_1-3\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRPG-p76-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p><p>Some of Delthuntle's specialties include oysters and pink <a href=\"/wiki/Pearl\" title=\"Pearl\">pearls</a>, as supplied by <a href=\"/wiki/Morada_Topolino\" title=\"Morada Topolino\">Morada Topolino</a>.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-TC-p169_3-0\"><a href=\"#cite_note-TC-p169-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p><p>The city suffered from some difficulty with pirates that patrol the coastline.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-FRPG-p76_1-4\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRPG-p76-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Demographics\">Demographics</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a aria-label=\"Edit section: Demographics\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-action=\"edit-section\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Delthuntle?veaction=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Demographics\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The city's trade with Akanûl helped give it one of the highest non-native genasi populations throughout <a href=\"/wiki/Faer%C3%BBn\" title=\"Faerûn\">Faerûn</a>.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-FRPG-p76_1-5\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRPG-p76-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p><p>There was a large <a href=\"/wiki/Halfling\" title=\"Halfling\">halfling</a> community in Delthuntle that was not seen as second class.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-TC-p211_4-0\"><a href=\"#cite_note-TC-p211-4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notable_Locations\">Notable Locations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a aria-label=\"Edit section: Notable Locations\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-action=\"edit-section\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Delthuntle?veaction=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Notable Locations\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><b><a href=\"/wiki/Morada_Topolino\" title=\"Morada Topolino\">Morada Topolino</a></b>, mansion belonging to Pericolo Topolino.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-TC-p135_5-0\"><a href=\"#cite_note-TC-p135-5\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>5<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></li>\n<li><b>The <span class=\"new\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvTGF6eV9GaXNoZXI/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\" title=\"Lazy Fisher (page does not exist)\">Lazy Fisher</span></b>, the inn closest to the water, run by <span class=\"new\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvU2hhc3RhX0Z1cmZvb3Q/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\" title=\"Shasta Furfoot (page does not exist)\">Shasta Furfoot</span><sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-TC-p121_6-0\"><a href=\"#cite_note-TC-p121-6\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>6<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> and later home to <a href=\"/wiki/Eiverbreen_Parrafin\" title=\"Eiverbreen Parrafin\">Eiverbreen Parrafin</a>.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-TC-p125_7-0\"><a href=\"#cite_note-TC-p125-7\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>7<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notable_Inhabitants\">Notable Inhabitants</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a aria-label=\"Edit section: Notable Inhabitants\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-action=\"edit-section\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Delthuntle?veaction=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Notable Inhabitants\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Duke <a href=\"/wiki/Raymond\" title=\"Raymond\">Raymond</a>, a noble from Delthuntle who once was liked in a bitter rivalry with the Duke of <span class=\"new\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvU3BhbmRlbGl5b24/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\" title=\"Spandeliyon (page does not exist)\">Spandeliyon</span>, <a href=\"/wiki/Edwall_Dest\" title=\"Edwall Dest\">Edwall Dest</a>.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-BG_8-0\"><a href=\"#cite_note-BG-8\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>8<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Spider_Parrafin\" title=\"Spider Parrafin\">Spider Parrafin</a> (the reincarnated <a href=\"/wiki/Regis\" title=\"Regis\">Regis</a>), halfling lad adopted by <a href=\"/wiki/Pericolo_Topolino\" title=\"Pericolo Topolino\">Pericolo Topolino</a>.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-TC-p168_9-0\"><a href=\"#cite_note-TC-p168-9\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>9<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Eiverbreen_Parrafin\" title=\"Eiverbreen Parrafin\">Eiverbreen Parrafin</a>, Spider's father.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-TC-p90_10-0\"><a href=\"#cite_note-TC-p90-10\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>10<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></li>\n<li><span class=\"new\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvSm9saWVfUGFycmFmaW4/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\" title=\"Jolie Parrafin (page does not exist)\">Jolie Parrafin</span>, Spider's mother.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-TC-p90_10-1\"><a href=\"#cite_note-TC-p90-10\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>10<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></li>\n<li><span class=\"new\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvU2hhc3RhX0Z1cmZvb3Q/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\" title=\"Shasta Furfoot (page does not exist)\">Shasta Furfoot</span>, halfling proprietor of the <span class=\"new\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvTGF6eV9GaXNoZXI/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\" title=\"Lazy Fisher (page does not exist)\">Lazy Fisher</span>.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-TC-p121_6-1\"><a href=\"#cite_note-TC-p121-6\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>6<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Pericolo_Topolino\" title=\"Pericolo Topolino\">Pericolo Topolino</a>, the wealthy \"Grandfather of Assassins.\"<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-TC-p123_11-0\"><a href=\"#cite_note-TC-p123-11\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>11<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Donnola_Topolino\" title=\"Donnola Topolino\">Donnola Topolino</a>, granddaughter of Pericolo<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-TC-p167_12-0\"><a href=\"#cite_note-TC-p167-12\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>12<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> and Spider's lover.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-TC-p213_13-0\"><a href=\"#cite_note-TC-p213-13\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>13<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Wigglefingers\" title=\"Wigglefingers\">Wigglefingers</a>, <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/wiki/Mage\" title=\"Mage\">mage</a> and advisor to Pericolo.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-TC-p167_12-1\"><a href=\"#cite_note-TC-p167-12\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>12<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></li>\n<li><span class=\"new\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQnJlZ25hbl9QcnVzP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\" title=\"Bregnan Prus (page does not exist)\">Bregnan Prus</span>, leader of a boy's gang in <a href=\"/wiki/1472_DR\" title=\"1472 DR\">1472 DR</a>.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-TC-p85_14-0\"><a href=\"#cite_note-TC-p85-14\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>14<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></li>\n<li><span class=\"new\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvUGF0ZXI/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\" title=\"Pater (page does not exist)\">Pater</span>, member of a boy's gang in <a href=\"/wiki/1472_DR\" title=\"1472 DR\">1472 DR</a>.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-TC-p85_14-1\"><a href=\"#cite_note-TC-p85-14\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>14<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appendix\">Appendix</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a aria-label=\"Edit section: Appendix\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-action=\"edit-section\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Delthuntle?veaction=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Appendix\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appearances\">Appearances</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a aria-label=\"Edit section: Appearances\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-action=\"edit-section\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Delthuntle?veaction=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Appearances\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<dl><dd><dl><dt>Novels</dt>\n<dd><i><a href=\"/wiki/The_Companions\" title=\"The Companions\">The Companions</a></i></dd>\n<dt>Video Games</dt>\n<dd><b><small>Referenced only</small></b></dd>\n<dd><small><i><a href=\"/wiki/Baldur%27s_Gate_(game)\" title=\"Baldur's Gate (game)